        <source>netzhirsch_ai_tag.license.help.scope</source>
        <target>Only burning the label into the generated image sizes requires a licence. Flagging files, the log, the audit export and the text alternative in the markup always work – access to your own records never depends on the licence.</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="netzhirsch_ai_tag.license.help.file">
        <source>netzhirsch_ai_tag.license.help.file</source>
        <target>The licence is bound to this installation. When moving to another server or domain, take the file along and then click "Refresh licence"; otherwise the server reports another installation (instance_mismatch).</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="netzhirsch_ai_tag.license.notice.not_enforced">
        <source>netzhirsch_ai_tag.license.notice.not_enforced</source>
        <target>This build of the bundle checks no licence: the label is always burnt in.</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="netzhirsch_ai_tag.license.notice.inactive">
        <source>netzhirsch_ai_tag.license.notice.inactive</source>
        <target>Without an active licence the label is not burnt into the images. Flagged images are delivered unchanged; only the text alternative remains in the markup.</target>
      </trans-unit>
